{"question_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2021a.q17", "exam": "NTCE", "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "source": {"type": "真题", "system": "国考", "session": "2021a", "paper": null, "variant": "全卷", "origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）题.csv", "verified": true}, "section": "单项选择题", "question_type": "单选", "material_id": null, "score": 2, "content": {"stem": "生物是自然界中有生命的物体，包括植物、动物和微生物，生物不仅具有多样性、而且具有一些共同的特征和属性。下列关于生物特征的表述，不正确的是（ ）。", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "都需要呼吸，吸入氧气，呼出二氧化碳"}, {"key": "B", "text": "都进行物质和能量代谢，得以生长发育"}, {"key": "C", "text": "都会对外界的刺激做出反应"}, {"key": "D", "text": "都会通过遗传保留种族特性"}], "answer": "A", "answer_status": "letter", "analysis": null}, "knowledge_node_ids": [], "difficulty": null, "review": {"status": "待复核", "tagger": null, "checked_by": null}, "extra": {"duplicate_of": null, "paper_order": 17}}
{"question_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2021a.q18", "exam": "NTCE", "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "source": {"type": "真题", "system": "国考", "session": "2021a", "paper": null, "variant": "全卷", "origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）题.csv", "verified": true}, "section": "单项选择题", "question_type": "单选", "material_id": null, "score": 2, "content": {"stem": "平原是绝对高度低于200米、相对高度小于50米的平缓陆地，是陆地地貌最基本的类型之一，世界大部分人口均居住在平原地区。世界上最大的平原是（ ）。", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "东欧平原"}, {"key": "B", "text": "亚马孙平原"}, {"key": "C", "text": "西西伯利亚平原"}, {"key": "D", "text": "长江中下游平原"}], "answer": "B", "answer_status": "letter", "analysis": null}, "knowledge_node_ids": [], "difficulty": null, "review": {"status": "待复核", "tagger": null, "checked_by": null}, "extra": {"duplicate_of": null, "paper_order": 18}}
{"question_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2021a.q19", "exam": "NTCE", "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "source": {"type": "真题", "system": "国考", "session": "2021a", "paper": null, "variant": "全卷", "origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）题.csv", "verified": true}, "section": "单项选择题", "question_type": "单选", "material_id": null, "score": 2, "content": {"stem": "我国的成语很多来源于含有历史人物、历史事件和那个时代的社会生活的典故。下列选项中，来源于汉代的人物和事件的成语是（ ）。", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "竭泽而渔"}, {"key": "B", "text": "完璧归赵"}, {"key": "C", "text": "马革裹尸"}, {"key": "D", "text": "洛阳纸贵"}], "answer": "C", "answer_status": "letter", "analysis": null}, "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m4"], "difficulty": null, "review": {"status": "待复核", "tagger": "rule-v1", "checked_by": null}, "extra": {"duplicate_of": null, "paper_order": 19}}
